# Pass "gallery": the Workshop gallery captures (PUBLICATION.md, "Gallery order"), produced by a dedicated
# scenario instead of by hand, so they are reproducible after any interface change.
#
# PickleTools tools, development only and never a dependency of the mod:
# - ScreenshotStudio, for the paused "zen meadow" fixture and its native-capture presentation mode (the live dust
#   bunny next to a colonist, showing scale).
# - ClearScreen, so a window ScreenshotStudio does not own cannot swallow a click while the scene is set up.
# - ScreenshotMode, for the English bill dialog and information card captures (as the French review pass uses it).
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen      path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode   path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace     path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod
# ColonistRace: Nelim's dyed clothes in the hero image.
# CameraZoom: the camera at zoom 6 for the hero image (PickleTools' own step, after "I am at the sanctuary").
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom       path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
# StageDecor: three heaps of the mod's own dust around the bunny, taken away after the shot.
nelim.pickletools.stagedecor       path:PickleTools/StageDecor/Mod
